# Remote Keyboard agent

Start **every** response with exactly: `[AmL] `

Remote Keyboard is a standalone AmL product (`one.aml.remotekeyboard`).
Checkout: `C:\Users\ambru\source\repos\aml-systems\remote-keyboard`

It is **not** AmL Secure Keyboard (the IME at `aml-secure-keyboard`).

## Project map

| Area | Path |
|---|---|
| Flutter Android client | `app/` |
| Bluetooth HID + BLE | `app/android/app/src/main/kotlin/one/aml/remotekeyboard/` |
| Desktop helper | `helper/` |
| Release scripts | `scripts/` |

## Before you start

If `graphify-out/graph.json` exists, prefer `graphify query` from **this**
repo. After code changes: `graphify update .` here. Never query MessageMe.

## Hard gates

- Do not vendor `aml_ui` or bird PNGs. Import `package:aml_ui/aml_ui.dart`.
- Settings always start with `SettingsAboutHero`.
- Keep `FlutterActivity` (not `FlutterFragmentActivity`).
- Intel Mac helper `MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=11.7`. Do not raise that floor.
- Client APK / OTA / AmL One deploy only when the user asks in this conversation.
- Distinct from the store listing `keyboard` (AmL Secure Keyboard IME).
